        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions WST150SMTFS, Offset Stainless Steel Selkirk Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA nice, simple pull, the Selkirk Stainless Steel Door Pull features a slightly modern look that makes it a good choice for both residential and commercial spaces. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. The Selkirk Handle is made from stainless steel and has offset mounts. It is available in a huge selection of finishes and can be ordered in 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Selkirk Offset Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SLK02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262336\"><b>First Impressions WST150SMTFS Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>WST150018SMTFS:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-4/25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST150024SMTFS:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-4/25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST150S036MTFS:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-4/25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This beautiful door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Selkirk Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "A nice, simple pull, the Selkirk Stainless Steel Door Pull features a slightly modern look that makes it a good choice for both residential and commercial spaces. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. The Selkirk Handle is made from stainless steel and has offset mounts. It is available in a huge selection of finishes and can be ordered in 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.",
